WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.450
Welcome to Module 7: Agentic AI Workflows.

2
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:10.750
An agent is a loop: it perceives, reasons, plans, acts, and learns.

3
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:21.580
You will learn the five stages of the agent loop, trace how information flows from one stage to the next, and run an end-to-end example that improves with feedback.

4
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:33.439
You will explore an interactive loop diagram, see the inputs and outputs of every stage, and learn the difference between learning inside one task and learning across many tasks.

5
00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:36.730
Then you will run a campus shuttle dispatcher in Python.

6
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:42.167
The key takeaway: an agent is a loop, not a single answer.

7
00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.160
Feedback from each cycle improves the next.
